# Testing

Test important behavior. Do not skip architecture just to make tests easy; inject dependencies so classes are naturally testable.

- Unit tests: domain, Cubit, services.
- Widget tests: UI behavior.
- Integration tests: full user flows.

Follow **Arrange → Act → Assert**. Prefer fakes/stubs over hitting real APIs.

```dart
test('emits error when service fails', () async {
  // arrange
  final cubit = HomeCubit(FakeUserService()..fail = true);
  // act
  await cubit.refresh();
  // assert
  expect(cubit.state, isA<HomeError>());
});
```
